WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.285
Burkĩna Faso sẽn be Burkĩni soolmẽ wã, sẽn pa zãr ne Banfora, tẽn-gãongã yikame n lebg tãnga.

00:00:08.365 --> 00:00:17.279
Yaa Sindou tãns-kãsems la woto: koomã la sobg-n-goamã, la kug-wõogã, b sẽn maan ne saagã la sãoongã.

00:00:17.359 --> 00:00:24.654
Zĩ-bãngdb yeelame tɩ bõn-kãensã sẽn yaa to-to wã yaa bũmb ning sẽn kɩt tɩ b sãame.

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:29.781
La yʋng sã n wa gũ Sindou, nin-kẽembã togsdame bũmb a to.

00:00:29.861 --> 00:00:34.188
B yetame tɩ pĩnd wẽndẽ, kug-kãensã ra pa yɛsa ye.

00:00:34.268 --> 00:00:41.923
Neb nins sẽn yaa yel-wẽn-maandbã dag n be be be, la ned kam fãa ra solgda yel-solemde.

00:00:42.003 --> 00:00:56.494
Neb nins sẽn da be pĩigã tẽngẽ wã ra segd n maana kaool ne nin-kãensã sẽn pa yãendã, tɩ b tõe n bɩɩs pʋɩɩrã, la b vɩɩmd ne bãane, b sã n sak zĩig ning b sẽn yãkã.

00:00:56.574 --> 00:01:02.880
Rẽ n so tɩ b yetame tɩ zĩis kẽer sẽn be tãensã zugã pa pak nebã fãa ye.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:10.255
D pa tõe n kẽng be wakat fãa ye, d pa segd n kelem ye, la d ka segd n dɩk bũmb ye.

00:01:10.335 --> 00:01:17.360
Neb nins sẽn maand bõn-kãense maandame n pʋʋs b sɩɩsã barka, n kos-b t'a saaga.

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:29.323
Neb nins sẽn togsd-b kibarã yetame tɩ kug ning b sẽn gʋlsã fãa tẽegda bũmb a to: sodaas sẽn yaa kãn-kãe, pag sẽn gũuda, rũms sẽn gõe.

00:01:29.403 --> 00:01:33.280
Bɩ ned kam fãa bãng-b la a kelg kãsem-dãmbã.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:41.555
Yaa woto la kom-bɩɩs nins sẽn be tãmb-tĩisẽ wã sã n bɩtẽ, b zãmsd-b tɩ b pa get-b wa kug ye.

00:01:41.635 --> 00:01:47.401
Rũndã-rũndã, neb wʋsg sẽn wat be tẽn-zẽmsẽ wã watame n na n gese.

00:01:47.481 --> 00:01:56.755
Sẽn na yɩl n wilg-b tɩ b kẽnda zĩig sẽn vɩ wã, b tẽegda b mens yelle, la b bãngd bũmb nins b sẽn maandã.
